# Aganox platform

- One repo = one deployable app ([APP_CATALOG](https://github.com/Arun01-hub/aganox-standards/blob/main/docs/APP_CATALOG.md)).
- Never commit secrets. Use gitignored `*.local.json`, `.env`, user secrets; commit only `*.example` templates.
- Prefer existing `scripts/*.ps1` on Windows over ad-hoc commands.
- Keep diffs small; match layer boundaries (Domain / Application / Infrastructure / host).
- Run the repo test command before claiming work is done.
- Do not add packages without clear need.
- Cross-repo work: list repos and start with Identity when OAuth is involved.